<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Where does this exception<br />actually get caught?</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Editors already highlight <code>try</code>/<code>catch</code> pairs inside
      one function. CatchMe follows an exception <strong>across</strong> function
      boundaries — through every caller — to the handler that really catches it.
    </p>
